1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,059
Haberlandt predicted it in nineteen oh two.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:06,067
Steward proved it in nineteen fifty seven.

3
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:16,080
He took single cells from carrot phloem, floated them in coconut water, and watched each one divide into a lump, then a plantlet, then a whole carrot.

